'''Talvash del Kissel''' is a [[gnome]] [[quest giver]] located in the [[Mystic Ward]] in [[Ironforge]]. He is a good friend of [[Mayva Togview]],<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|40|Mastering Goldsmithing (Alliance)|Mastering Goldsmithing|profession=jewelcrafting}}</ref> and his tutor in jewelcrafting and goldsmithing was the mysterious highborne known as [[the Artificer]].<ref name="The Artificer" />

He was a jeweler in [[Gnomeregan]] and specializes in goldsmithing. Though skilled and passionate about his work, after the fall of Gnomeregan he was reduced to renting out a home in Ironforge, and his business suffered when a competitor started a rumor that his jewelry was cursed,<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|42D|Back to Uldaman}}</ref> resulting in him falling in debt, experience difficulties when trying to engage in good and honest trade in the city,<ref name="You Should Put A Ring On It">{{questlong|Alliance|40|You Should Put A Ring On It|profession=jewelcrafting}}</ref> and often requiring to go through various means to pay his rent and appease his landlord.<ref name="Left In Bad Faith">{{questlong|Alliance|44D|Left In Bad Faith|profession=jewelcrafting}}</ref><ref name="You Should Put A Ring On It" /> Through unfortunate coincidence, many of his clients have met unfortunate ends, including the paladin whose death on a self-appointed quest to clear out the "evil taint" in [[Uldaman]] first started the rumors and a mage who purchased a spell-enhancing necklace for a venture into an ill-fated [[Gilneas City]].<ref name="Left In Bad Faith" />

